  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Creation sphere, Telekinesis sphere, caster level 7th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can create items out of telekinetic force instead of matter. Objects made this way cannot incorporate any other materials and must be simple in construction, lacking intricate details or complex moving parts. This ‘material’ has hardness 10 and 3 hit points per inch, has no weight and cannot be moved, save by you through telekinesis. At the end of each round its hit points are fully replenished. Unlike other created objects, objects of telekinetic force are magical and can be dispelled, which also destroys them.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Telekinetic force made with the Create Materials advanced talent reforms itself over the course of an hour if destroyed, but not if dispelled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/creation#toc76\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
